        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reya's Garden World Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual 2D clearance game featuring VTuber &quot;Reya Ostereich&quot; - a colossal dragon girl - and her companions in a miniature-scale adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since we are a very small team of only two people, the game might indeed have some issues. ​<strong>​Before purchasing the game officially, it is crucial that you check the following information:​</strong>​</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​Not being able to click on the character selection screen is NOT a bug; you need to press A or D on your keyboard to navigate.​</strong>​</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​To trigger CGs (special images) within the game:​</strong>​</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Levels 1 and 2 with ​<strong>​Rayah​</strong>​.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Levels 3 and 4 with ​<strong>​a character unlocked later​</strong>​.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so on and so forth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each of the five characters has played two levels, if there are more levels, play them with ​<strong>​Claire​</strong>​.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(This is basically because we honestly had no idea how to implement a character-unlock system tied to progression).</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​The dragging maneuver is performed by holding down the Spacebar and then pressing A or D.​</strong>​</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>​CGs are stored in the game's root directory.​</strong>​ If you absolutely cannot get the game to run properly:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can view the CGs directly in the root folder – they are the original image files.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are eligible for a refund.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can consider it buying the CGs with a free game attached, as the game has no anti-piracy measures (and we certainly don't know how to implement them).</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter minor issues, try restarting the game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/0616c27b17da99fb37861fdefa052569.avif?t=1754859888\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras_big/0616c27b17da99fb37861fdefa052569.avif?t=1754859888 width=800 height=342 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Premise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vile Goblin Legion has invaded a neighboring kingdom of the Austerich Dragon Empire, seizing its facilities. Now they’re transforming human towns into military footholds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put a stop to their expansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ostereich’s giant dragon girl: harness your world-shattering power to stomp flat every annoying goblin and shatter occupied structures before they become tools of destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/864d58bc35d9627e4a6eaaf1cede7a0a.poster.avif?t=1754859888\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/864d58bc35d9627e4a6eaaf1cede7a0a.webm?t=1754859888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/864d58bc35d9627e4a6eaaf1cede7a0a.mp4?t=1754859888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Giantess Art Collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 11 stunning illustrations showcasing the unique moe appeal of colossal maidens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate Playable Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of other VTubers and freely crush &amp; trample your way through Garden World!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for Giantess Enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880650/extras/b76d093692e262760fe3b2cbbc829b5d.avif?t=1754859888\" width=800 height=1132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
